START

Initialize value V(s) = 0 for all states

Set discount factor γ
Set convergence limit θ

REPEAT

    Set Δ = 0

    FOR each state s:

        IF s is Goal or Obstacle:
            Continue

        Calculate value for each possible action:

            Q(s,a) =
            Reward(s,a) +
            γ × V(next_state)

        Update:

            V(s) = MAX Q(s,a)

        Calculate change Δ

    END FOR

UNTIL Δ < θ

FOR each state s:

    Select action with highest Q(s,a)
    Store it as the optimal policy

END FOR

Display optimal value function
Display optimal policy

STOP
